   <text>
      <body>
         <div type="letter">
                <div type="mainBody">
                    <gap reason="published"/>
                    <p>
                        <seg type="published" function="context">
                            <quote>I agree, of course, to the proposed change in our agreement or to any other you may suggest.</quote>
                            <bibl>LI 115-16</bibl>
                        </seg>
                    </p>
                    <p>        	If you care to send a few copies (sale or return) to Denmark the following bookshops will take them on.</p>
                    <p>1) A. Ersler’s Boghandel</p>
                    <p>Köbmagergade 26, Copenhagen</p> <p>2) Vor Frue Boglade</p>
                    <p>Nörregade 13, Copenhagen</p> <p>3 )V. Pio’s Boghandel</p>
                    <p>Nörregade 13, Copenhagen</p> <p>4) Steen Kasselbalch’s Forlag</p>
                    <p>Köbmagergade 26, Copenhagen</p>  <p>
                        <seg type="published" function="context">
                            <quote>A <name type="person">Miss Maja Maag</name>, Ahlmannsallée 15, Hellerup, Denmark, is thinking of translating the book into Danish.</quote>
                            <bibl>LI 116</bibl>
                        </seg>
                    </p>
